&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;line-height:8pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;Pacific Rim Corporation入社(米国)&lt;br/&gt; 同社Directorに就任&lt;/p&gt;
